"0\\\">\\n<br>    [cite_start]The deli sells ham for <b>\\\\$3.95 per pound</b> (<span class=\\\"katex\\\"><span class=\\\"katex-mathml\\\"><math xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\\\"><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow>h</math></span><span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" class=\\\"katex-html\\\"><span class=\\\"base\\\"><span style=\\\"height:0.6944em;\\\" class=\\\"strut\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mord mathnormal\\\">h</span></span></span></span>), turkey for <b>\\\\$4.30 per pound</b> (<span class=\\\"katex\\\"><span class=\\\"katex-mathml\\\"><math xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\\\"><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow>t</math></span><span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" class=\\\"katex-html\\\"><span class=\\\"base\\\"><span style=\\\"height:0.6151em;\\\" class=\\\"strut\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mord mathnormal\\\">t</span></span></span></span>), and cheese for <b>\\\\$3.10 per pound</b> (<span class=\\\"katex\\\"><span class=\\\"katex-mathml\\\"><math xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\\\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow>c</math></span><span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" class=\\\"katex-html\\\"><span class=\\\"base\\\"><span style=\\\"height:0.4306em;\\\" class=\\\"strut\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mord mathnormal\\\">c</span></span></span></span>)[cite: 347]. [cite_start]Write an expression for the total cost, then find the cost for 1 pound of ham, 1.5 pounds of turkey, and 2.3 pounds of cheese[cite: 349].\\n<br>    &gt; <b>Answer:</b> Expression: <span class=\\\"katex\\\"><span class=\\\"katex-mathml\\\"><math xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\\\"><mrow><mn>3.95</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4.30</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3.10</mn><mi>c</mi></mrow>3.95h + 4.30t + 3.10c</math></span><span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" class=\\\"katex-html\\\"><span class=\\\"base\\\"><span style=\\\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\\\" class=\\\"strut\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mord\\\">3.95</span><span class=\\\"mord mathnormal\\\">h</span><span style=\\\"margin-right:0.2222em;\\\" class=\\\"mspace\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mbin\\\">+</span><span style=\\\"margin-right:0.2222em;\\\" class=\\\"mspace\\\"></span></span><span class=\\\"base\\\"><span style=\\\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\\\" class=\\\"strut\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mord\\\">4.30</span><span class=\\\"mord mathnormal\\\">t</span><span style=\\\"margin-right:0.2222em;\\\" class=\\\"mspace\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mbin\\\">+</span><span style=\\\"margin-right:0.2222em;\\\" class=\\\"mspace\\\"></span></span><span class=\\\"base\\\"><span style=\\\"height:0.6444em;\\\" class=\\\"strut\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mord\\\">3.10</span><span class=\\\"mord mathnormal\\\">c</span></span></span></span>. [cite_start]Cost: <span class=\\\"katex\\\"><span class=\\\"katex-mathml\\\"><math xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\\\"><mrow><mn>3.95</mn><mo stretchy=\\\"false\\\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\\\"false\\\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>4.30</mn><mo stretchy=\\\"false\\\">(</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mo stretchy=\\\"false\\\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>3.10</mn><mo stretchy=\\\"false\\\">(</mo><mn>2.3</mn><mo stretchy=\\\"false\\\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\\\"normal\\\">$</mi><mn>17.53</mn></mrow>3.95(1) + 4.30(1.5) + 3.10(2.3) = \\\\$17.53</math></span><span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" class=\\\"katex-html\\\"><span class=\\\"base\\\"><span style=\\\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\\\" class=\\\"strut\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mord\\\">3.95</span><span class=\\\"mopen\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"mord\\\">1</span><span class=\\\"mclose\\\">)</span><span style=\\\"margin-right:0.2222em;\\\" class=\\\"mspace\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mbin\\\">+</span><span style=\\\"margin-right:0.2222em;\\\" class=\\\"mspace\\\"></span></span><span class=\\\"base\\\"><span style=\\\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\\\" class=\\\"strut\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mord\\\">4.30</span><span class=\\\"mopen\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"mord\\\">1.5</span><span class=\\\"mclose\\\">)</span><span style=\\\"margin-right:0.2222em;\\\" class=\\\"mspace\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mbin\\\">+</span><span style=\\\"margin-right:0.2222em;\\\" class=\\\"mspace\\\"></span></span><span class=\\\"base\\\"><span style=\\\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\\\" class=\\\"strut\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mord\\\">3.10</span><span class=\\\"mopen\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"mord\\\">2.3</span><span class=\\\"mclose\\\">)</span><span style=\\\"margin-right:0.2778em;\\\" class=\\\"mspace\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mrel\\\">=</span><span style=\\\"margin-right:0.2778em;\\\" class=\\\"mspace\\\"></span></span><span class=\\\"base\\\"><span style=\\\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\\\" class=\\\"strut\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mord\\\">$17.53</span></span></span></span>[cite: 350].\\n<br></p><div><b>9.</b> ### Problem Solving</div><p style=\\\"animation: 0s ease 0s 1 normal none running none; appearance: none; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); border-style: none; border-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); border-image: initial; inset: auto; clear: none; clip: auto; columns: auto; contain: none; container: none; content: normal; cursor: auto; cx: 0px; cy: 0px; d: none; direction: ltr; fill: rgb(0, 0, 0); filter: none; flex: 0 1 auto; float: none; gap: normal; hyphens: manual; interactivity: auto; isolation: auto; margin-bottom: 16px; marker: none; mask: none; offset: normal; opacity: 1; order: 0; outline: rgb(31, 31, 31) none 0px; overlay: none; padding: 0px; page: auto; perspective: none; position: static; quotes: auto; r: 0px; resize: none; rotate: none; rx: auto; ry: auto; scale: none; speak: normal; stroke: none; transform: none; transition: all; translate: none; visibility: visible; x: 0px; y: 0px; zoom: 1; margin-top: 0px !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;\\\" data-path-to-node=\\\"0\\\">\\n<br>    [cite_start]Tamera charges <b>\\\\$7 per hour</b> (<span class=\\\"katex\\\"><span class=\\\"katex-mathml\\\"><math xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\\\"><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow>h</math></span><span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" class=\\\"katex-html\\\"><span class=\\\"base\\\"><span style=\\\"height:0.6944em;\\\" class=\\\"strut\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mord mathnormal\\\">h</span></span></span></span>) for sitting one dog and <b>\\\\$15 per day</b> for one or two cats[cite: 343]. [cite_start]She sat for one dog for <span class=\\\"katex\\\"><span class=\\\"katex-mathml\\\"><math xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\\\"><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow>h</math></span><span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" class=\\\"katex-html\\\"><span class=\\\"base\\\"><span style=\\\"height:0.6944em;\\\" class=\\\"strut\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mord mathnormal\\\">h</span></span></span></span> hours and two cats for 2 days[cite: 337, 338]. [cite_start]Write an expression for her earnings, then evaluate it if she sat for the dog for 2 hours[cite: 341].\\n<br>    &gt; <b>Answer:</b> Expression: <span class=\\\"katex\\\"><span class=\\\"katex-mathml\\\"><math xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\\\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow>7h + 2 \\\\cdot 15</math></span><span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" class=\\\"katex-html\\\"><span class=\\\"base\\\"><span style=\\\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\\\" class=\\\"strut\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mord\\\">7</span><span class=\\\"mord mathnormal\\\">h</span><span style=\\\"margin-right:0.2222em;\\\" class=\\\"mspace\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mbin\\\">+</span><span style=\\\"margin-right:0.2222em;\\\" class=\\\"mspace\\\"></span></span><span class=\\\"base\\\"><span style=\\\"height:0.6444em;\\\" class=\\\"strut\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mord\\\">2</span><span style=\\\"margin-right:0.2222em;\\\" class=\\\"mspace\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mbin\\\">⋅</span><span style=\\\"margin-right:0.2222em;\\\" class=\\\"mspace\\\"></span></span><span class=\\\"base\\\"><span style=\\\"height:0.6444em;\\\" class=\\\"strut\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mord\\\">15</span></span></span></span>. [cite_start]Evaluation: <span class=\\\"katex\\\"><span class=\\\"katex-mathml\\\"><math xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\\\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo stretchy=\\\"false\\\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\\\"false\\\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\\\"normal\\\">$</mi><mn>44</mn></mrow>7(2) + 30 = \\\\$44</math></span><span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" class=\\\"katex-html\\\"><span class=\\\"base\\\"><span style=\\\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\\\" class=\\\"strut\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mord\\\">7</span><span class=\\\"mopen\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"mord\\\">2</span><span class=\\\"mclose\\\">)</span><span style=\\\"margin-right:0.2222em;\\\" class=\\\"mspace\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mbin\\\">+</span><span style=\\\"margin-right:0.2222em;\\\" class=\\\"mspace\\\"></span></span><span class=\\\"base\\\"><span style=\\\"height:0.6444em;\\\" class=\\\"strut\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mord\\\">30</span><span style=\\\"margin-right:0.2778em;\\\" class=\\\"mspace\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mrel\\\">=</span><span style=\\\"margin-right:0.2778em;\\\" class=\\\"mspace\\\"></span></span><span class=\\\"base\\\"><span style=\\\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\\\" class=\\\"strut\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mord\\\">$44</span></span></span></span>[cite: 342].\\n<br></p><div><b>10.</b> ### Problem Solving</div><p style=\\\"animation: 0s ease 0s 1 normal none running none; appearance: none; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); border-style: none; border-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); border-image: initial; inset: auto; clear: none; clip: auto; columns: auto; contain: none; container: none; content: normal; cursor: auto; cx: 0px; cy: 0px; d: none; direction: ltr; fill: rgb(0, 0, 0); filter: none; flex: 0 1 auto; float: none; gap: normal; hyphens: manual; interactivity: auto; isolation: auto; margin-bottom: 16px; marker: none; mask: none; offset: normal; opacity: 1; order: 0; outline: rgb(31, 31, 31) none 0px; overlay: none; padding: 0px; page: auto; perspective: none; position: static; quotes: auto; r: 0px; resize: none; rotate: none; rx: auto; ry: auto; scale: none; speak: normal; stroke: none; transform: none; transition: all; translate: none; visibility: visible; x: 0px; y: 0px; zoom: 1; margin-top: 0px !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;\\\" data-path-to-node=\\\"0\\\">\\n<br>    [cite_start]Juan rented a paddleboard for <b>\\\\$5.75 per hour</b> plus a <b>\\\\$17.50 fee</b>[cite: 352]. [cite_start]Write an expression for the cost of renting the paddleboard for <span class=\\\"katex\\\"><span class=\\\"katex-mathml\\\"><math xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\\\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow>x</math></span><span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" class=\\\"katex-html\\\"><span class=\\\"base\\\"><span style=\\\"height:0.4306em;\\\" class=\\\"strut\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mord mathnormal\\\">x</span></span></span></span> hours, and then evaluate the expression for a rental of <b>3 hours</b>[cite: 353].\\n<br>    &gt; <b>Answer:</b> Expression: <span class=\\\"katex\\\"><span class=\\\"katex-mathml\\\"><math xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\\\"><mrow><mn>5.75</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>17.5</mn></mrow>5.75x + 17.5</math></span><span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" class=\\\"katex-html\\\"><span class=\\\"base\\\"><span style=\\\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\\\" class=\\\"strut\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mord\\\">5.75</span><span class=\\\"mord mathnormal\\\">x</span><span style=\\\"margin-right:0.2222em;\\\" class=\\\"mspace\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mbin\\\">+</span><span style=\\\"margin-right:0.2222em;\\\" class=\\\"mspace\\\"></span></span><span class=\\\"base\\\"><span style=\\\"height:0.6444em;\\\" class=\\\"strut\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mord\\\">17.5</span></span></span></span>. [cite_start]Evaluation: <span class=\\\"katex\\\"><span class=\\\"katex-mathml\\\"><math xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\\\"><mrow><mn>5.75</mn><mo stretchy=\\\"false\\\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\\\"false\\\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>17.5</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\\\"normal\\\">$</mi><mn>34.75</mn></mrow>5.75(3) + 17.5 = \\\\$34.75</math></span><span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" class=\\\"katex-html\\\"><span class=\\\"base\\\"><span style=\\\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\\\" class=\\\"strut\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mord\\\">5.75</span><span class=\\\"mopen\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"mord\\\">3</span><span class=\\\"mclose\\\">)</span><span style=\\\"margin-right:0.2222em;\\\" class=\\\"mspace\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mbin\\\">+</span><span style=\\\"margin-right:0.2222em;\\\" class=\\\"mspace\\\"></span></span><span class=\\\"base\\\"><span style=\\\"height:0.6444em;\\\" class=\\\"strut\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mord\\\">17.5</span><span style=\\\"margin-right:0.2778em;\\\" class=\\\"mspace\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mrel\\\">=</span><span style=\\\"margin-right:0.2778em;\\\" class=\\\"mspace\\\"></span></span><span class=\\\"base\\\"><span style=\\\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\\\" class=\\\"strut\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mord\\\">$34.75</span></span></span></span>[cite: 354].</p></div>\"}', '2025-11-28 16:51:24', '2025-11-28 16:51:24');
INSERT INTO `lesson_presentation_slides` (`id`, `lesson_presentation_id`, `section`, `slide_type`, `slide_content`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(28, 1, 'learn', 'text', '{\"text\": \"<p>Absolutely — let’s elevate the assessment experience by appending a clean, high-impact <strong>Bonus Section</strong> with three evaluation-style items. Here is the fully refreshed quiz with the new bonus tier integrated seamlessly at the end.</p>\\n<hr>\\n<h1><strong>Grade 6 Math – Review Quiz (Version 2.2)</strong></h1>\\n<p><strong>Total: 20 marks + Bonus</strong></p>\\n<hr>\\n<h2><strong>Part A – Multiple Choice (5 × 1 = 5 marks)</strong></h2>\\n<ol>\\n<li>\\n<p>What is the base in the expression <strong>5⁷</strong>?<br>\\nA) 7  B) 12  C) 5  D) 35</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>Evaluate <strong>3⁴</strong>.<br>\\nA) 12  B) 64  C) 81  D) 27</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>What is the GCF of <strong>21 and 28</strong>?<br>\\nA) 7  B) 4  C) 3  D) 14</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>Evaluate <strong>40 ÷ (12 – 4) + 4²</strong>.<br>\\nA) 9  B) 21  C) 18  D) 20</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>The algebraic expression for <strong>“five more than a number”</strong> is<br>\\nA) n + 5  B) 5 – n  C) n – 5  D) 5n</p>\\n</li>\\n</ol>\\n<hr>\\n<h2><strong>Part B – Matching (10 × 1 = 10 marks)</strong></h2>\\n<table>\\n<thead>\\n<tr>\\n<th>#</th>\\n<th>Column A</th>\\n<th></th>\\n<th>Column B</th>\\n</tr>\\n</thead>\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td>1</td>\\n<td>4³</td>\\n<td>→</td>\\n<td>A) 16</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>2</td>\\n<td>(2/3)²</td>\\n<td>→</td>\\n<td>B) 8</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>3</td>\\n<td>GCF of 32 and 48</td>\\n<td>→</td>\\n<td>C) 9</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>4</td>\\n<td>LCM of 5 and 7</td>\\n<td>→</td>\\n<td>D) 49</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>5</td>\\n<td>2⁵</td>\\n<td>→</td>\\n<td>E) 1/9</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>6</td>\\n<td>Evaluate 9 × 2 + 18 ÷ 3</td>\\n<td>→</td>\\n<td>F) 63</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>7</td>\\n<td>Expression for “a number plus 11”</td>\\n<td>→</td>\\n<td>G) n + 11</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>8</td>\\n<td>Expression for “a number divided by 4”</td>\\n<td>→</td>\\n<td>H) n/4</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>9</td>\\n<td>Evaluate 4² × 2 – 6</td>\\n<td>→</td>\\n<td>I) 22</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>10</td>\\n<td>Number of terms in 7x – 4 + 5</td>\\n<td>→</td>\\n<td>J) 3</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<hr>\\n<h2><strong>Part C – Problem Solving (5 × 1 = 5 marks)</strong></h2>\\n<ol>\\n<li>\\n<p>Evaluate <strong>6² – 4 × 3</strong>.<br>\\nAnswer: __________________</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>Two lights flash: one every <strong>9 minutes</strong>, the other every <strong>12 minutes</strong>.<br>\\nThey start together at 1:00. When is the next time they flash together?<br>\\nAnswer: __________________</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>Pens cost <strong>$3</strong> each and markers cost <strong>$4</strong> each.<br>\\nWrite an expression for <strong>p</strong> pens and <strong>m</strong> markers, then find the cost for <strong>5 pens and 2 markers</strong>.<br>\\nExpression: __________________<br>\\nCost: $ __________________</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>Evaluate <strong>7² + 20 ÷ 5</strong>.<br>\\nAnswer: __________________</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>T-shirts cost <strong>$12 each</strong>, hats cost <strong>$7 each</strong>.<br>\\nWrite an expression for <strong>t</strong> T-shirts and <strong>h</strong> hats, then find the cost for <strong>2 T-shirts and 5 hats</strong>.<br>\\nExpression: __________________<br>\\nCost: $ __________________</p>\\n</li>\\n</ol>\\n<hr>\\n<h1><strong>Bonus Questions (Not included in the 20 marks)</strong></h1>\\n<p><strong>Bonus 1:</strong> Evaluate <strong>3² × 5 – 7</strong><br>\\nAnswer: __________________</p>\\n<p><strong>Bonus 2:</strong> Evaluate <strong>50 ÷ (15 – 5) + 6</strong><br>\\nAnswer: __________________</p>\\n<p><strong>Bonus 3:</strong> Evaluate <strong>2³ + 4² – 10</strong><br>\\nAnswer: __________________</p>\\n<hr>\\n<h1><strong>Answer Key (Version 2.2)</strong></h1>\\n<h2>Part A</h2>\\n<ol>\\n<li>\\n<p>C</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>D</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>A</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>B</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>A</p>\\n</li>\\n</ol>\\n<h2>Part B</h2>\\n<ol>\\n<li>\\n<p>C</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>E</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>A</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>F</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>B</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>I</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>G</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>H</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>B</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>J</p>\\n</li>\\n</ol>\\n<h2>Part C</h2>\\n<ol>\\n<li>\\n<p>24</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>1:36</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>Expression: 3p + 4m<br>\\nCost: 23</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>53</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>Expression: 12t + 7h<br>\\nCost: 59</p>\\n</li>\\n</ol>\\n<h2>Bonus</h2>\\n<ol>\\n<li>\\n<p>3² × 5 – 7 → 9 × 5 – 7 = <strong>38</strong></p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>50 ÷ 10 + 6 = <strong>11</strong></p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>8 + 16 – 10 = <strong>14</strong></p>\\n</li>\\n</ol>\\n<hr>\\n<p>If you\'d like, I can package this as a <strong>ready-to-print PDF</strong>, or produce a <strong>Version 2.3</strong> with fresh numbers.</p>\"}', '2025-12-04 01:24:56', '2025-12-04 01:24:56');
