(28, 1, 8, 1, NULL, 'fractions', 'Let\'s solve each question and verify the answers provided:\n\n---\n\n### 1) What is \\( \\frac{1}{6} + \\frac{2}{6} \\) ?\n- \\( \\frac{1+2}{6} = \\frac{3}{6} \\)\n- ✅ Correct answer: **C**\n\n---\n\n### 2) What is \\( \\frac{5}{8} - \\frac{2}{8} \\) ?\n- \\( \\frac{5-2}{8} = \\frac{3}{8} \\)\n- ✅ Correct answer: **A**\n\n---\n\n### 3) What is \\( 2\\frac{3}{5} + 1\\frac{1}{5} \\) ?\n- Convert to improper: \\( \\frac{13}{5} + \\frac{6}{5} = \\frac{19}{5} = 3\\frac{4}{5} \\)\n- ✅ Correct answer: **B**\n\n---\n\n### 4) What is \\( 4\\frac{2}{3} - 2\\frac{1}{3} \\) ?\n- Convert to improper: \\( \\frac{14}{3} - \\frac{7}{3} = \\frac{7}{3} = 2\\frac{1}{3} \\)\n- ✅ Correct answer: **B**\n\n---\n\n### 5) What is \\( 5\\frac{5}{7} + 3\\frac{3}{7} \\) ?\n- Add whole numbers and fractions: \\( 5+3 = 8 \\), \\( \\frac{5}{7} + \\frac{3}{7} = \\frac{8}{7} = 1\\frac{1}{7} \\)\n- Total: \\( 8 + 1\\frac{1}{7} = 9\\frac{1}{7} \\)\n- ✅ Correct answer: **A**\n\n---\n\n### 6) What is \\( 7\\frac{1}{9} - 3\\frac{8}{9} \\) ?\n- Convert: \\( \\frac{64}{9} - \\frac{35}{9} = \\frac{29}{9} = 3\\frac{2}{9} \\)\n- ✅ Correct answer: **B**\n\n---\n\n### 7) What is \\( \\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{2}{3} \\) ?\n- \\( \\frac{1+2}{3} = \\frac{3}{3} = 1 \\)\n- ✅ Correct answer: **D**\n\n---\n\n### 8) The Right angle = .........\n- ✅ Correct answer: **B) 90°**\n\n---\n\n### 9) The straight angle = .........\n- ✅ Correct answer: **C) 180°**\n\n---\n\n### 10) ............... is a part of a line with two endpoints.\n- ✅ Correct answer: **C) line segment**\n\n---\n\n### ✅ Summary of Correct Answers:\n1. C  \n2. A  \n3. B  \n4. B  \n5. A  \n6. B  \n7. D  \n8. B  \n9. C  \n10. C\n\n---\n\n### 🔍 Mistakes:\n- **No mistakes in the printed options**. All correct answers are present in the options and correctly formatted.\n\nLet me know if you want these on a filled-in version or need explanations for any specific question.', '[{\"option\": null, \"feedback\": null, \"isCorrect\": false}]', NULL, 'mcq', 1, 'medium', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{\"id\": 1744472969876, \"note\": null, \"step\": null}]', NULL, 14, '2025-04-12 12:50:32', '2025-04-12 12:50:32'),
